catflow 0.8
1. Read Audio           episode.mp3
2. Transcribe           Whisper Large v3; timestamps=true
3. <parallel notes>   text -> [text, text, text]
     1. Summarize   (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "Episode summary, one paragraph"

     2. Draft       (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "Chapter list with timestamps, from
                                the transcript's time marks"

     3. Draft       (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "3 pull quotes, verbatim"
4. Merge                Qwen3 8B; "Markdown show notes: summary, chapters,
                        quotes"
5. Title                Ministral 3B; "episode title, catchy"
6. Template     (5,4)   "# {1}\n\n{2}"
7. Save Text            shownotes.md
